         body='THREE. (continued)\n  AFTER DECOMPILING (CFR 0.152, from Licence.class alone):\n    public static boolean check(String string) {\n        if (string == null) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        return VENDOR_KEY.equals(string);\n    }\n  WHAT CAME BACK:\n    the key     VENDOR_KEY = "bankapp-demo-key-0001";\n    the logic   the same, written shorter\n    lost        the parameter name (key became string)\n    the file    19 non-blank lines, the original 20',
